  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zero Discrimination Association</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Turkey. The main outcome areas it contributes to are democracy and human rights and gender equality. The main right holders are youth within the Roma community in Turkey. Through campaigning, trainings, organising and capacity building and the establishment of a popular education programme called  The Other School of Politics  the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
